        "quote": "(a) The Council may, by resolution, reimburse developers for any intersections, including curb, gutter and storm sewers, which the developer has constructed pursuant to subdivision rules and regulations or other requirements of the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.45.050:block:0#text",
